text = "[color=\"orange\"]Chat:[/color]

We need to come up with the perfect disguise for our cryptids!

Make suggestions by entering the [color=\"orange\"]!request[/color] command in the Twitch chat. How these prompts will be used is up to the interpretation of our Streamer.

Prompts must not contain spaces. Be creative! Use hyphens to string words together. (ex: \"three-eyes\", \"sharp-fangs\", etc.)

[color=\"orange\"]Streamer:[/color]

Once you're satisfied with the number of entered requests. Press the Shuffle Prompts button, to start the game. All submitted prompts will be shuffled into a deck, and a random selection will be chosen for you to follow!
"
fit_content = true
